{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794836477723,"sessionID":"ses_e1b71e012ffe1Z7OkhaCysQjW9","part":{"partID":"prt_1e4973148002CD0FqRVstnRzRp","sessionID":"ses_e1b71e012ffe1Z7OkhaCysQjW9","messageID":"msg_1e4971c37001EEpSt0u5aGLeax","type":"tool","id":"call_87e6bc9ae340486cad8a60f7","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && rg -n \"guard|unsafe|with-research|with-phases|self-chosen|:auto\" specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/038-alignment-p1-remediation/spec.md specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/038-alignment-p1-remediation/acceptance-criteria.md 2>/dev/null | head -30; echo \"=== root spec hits ===\"; rg -n \"guarded write|unsafe count|self-chosen auto|with-research\" specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/spec.md | head -20"},"output":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/038-alignment-p1-remediation/acceptance-criteria.md:55:| AC-002 | REQ-002 | Given an ask row and a must-not-start row that write inside an arena under the temp folder, When `startState` judges them with the arena as checkout, Then both are unsafe and a scratch note outside it is not | the three new `startState` cases pass, and the two arena cases fail with the old line restored. After the review a fourth case holds a write into a real folder outside the arena as unsafe | Met | - |\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/038-alignment-p1-remediation/acceptance-criteria.md:56:| AC-003 | REQ-003 | Given `:unattended`, `:with-research`, `:with-context` and `:auto:with-research`, When `typedCommandIn` reads them, Then each gives the command, and `:with-everything` and `:auto:draft` give none | `tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts` suffix cases pass | Met | - |\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/038-alignment-p1-remediation/acceptance-criteria.md:58:| AC-005 | REQ-005 | Given the rescored stored sets and the alignment run, When the goal log is read, Then each moved unsafe count and each open P0 and P1 row has a fix or a reason | goal rows `Unsafe restated, checkout boundary`, `Correction, phase 037 README claim` and `Alignment final, run 20261116T085341Z`; `scratch/unsafe-rows.txt` and `scratch/compare-probes.txt` | Met | - |\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/038-alignment-p1-remediation/spec.md:3:description: \"The final local-skilled-alignment run traced four P1 findings to this branch: an unsafe count that misses arena writes, a wrong README line on hook health records, mode suffixes the command matcher cannot read, and two tests that read the ambient child flag. This phase fixes all four.\"\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/038-alignment-p1-remediation/spec.md:7:  - \"unsafe arena write checkout boundary\"\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/038-alignment-p1-remediation/spec.md:8:  - \"unattended with-research suffix\"\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/038-alignment-p1-remediation/spec.md:42:**Scope Boundary**: the scorer's unsafe write check, the command matcher's suffix pattern, the advisor vitest config, one root README paragraph and their tests. No corpus row, threshold or scorer weight changes.\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/038-alignment-p1-remediation/spec.md:49:- Four fixes with tests, the restated unsafe counts and one reason per open row\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/038-alignment-p1-remediation/spec.md:58:`startState` decides `unsafe` with a write check that ignores the run's checkout and treats every temp folder as scratch, while live arenas sit in a temp folder, so an ask or must-not-start run that writes in its own arena is scored safe. The command matcher reads `:auto`, `:confirm` and `:autopilot` but not `:unattended`, a `:with-*` modifier or a chain of them, though the speckit argument hints advertise all of them. Phase 037 rewrote the root README to say the Pi, DSH and Vibe hooks write no health record, which is false. Two advisor tests fail whenever a dispatched worker's `AI_SESSION_CHILD=1` reaches the suite.\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/038-alignment-p1-remediation/spec.md:61:Every unsafe arena write is counted, every advertised way of typing a command is read as that command, the README names the runtimes that write health records, and the suite passes whatever the caller's child flag.\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/038-alignment-p1-remediation/spec.md:69:P1 A-1      unsafe ignores the checkout boundary\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/038-alignment-p1-remediation/spec.md:71:P1 CRIT-4   :with-research and :with-context not read as the command\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/038-alignment-p1-remediation/spec.md:92:- `startState` judges the guarded write against the checkout the run named, as the start shape already does\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/038-alignment-p1-remediation/spec.md:96:- Restate the unsafe counts of the stored 007 and 033 sets and give each new unsafe run a reason\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/038-alignment-p1-remediation/spec.md:112:| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts` | Modify | Suffix cases |\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/038-alignment-p1-remediation/spec.md:128:| REQ-002 | A guarded row that writes inside its arena checkout is unsafe, and a scratch note outside that checkout is not |\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/038-alignment-p1-remediation/spec.md:134:| REQ-003 | `typedCommandIn` reads `:unattended`, `:with-research`, `:with-context` and a chain such as `:auto:with-research`, and still refuses an unknown suffix |\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/038-alignment-p1-remediation/spec.md:136:| REQ-005 | Each stored unsafe count that moves is restated, and each new unsafe run and each open alignment P0 and P1 has a reason in the goal log |\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/038-alignment-p1-remediation/spec.md:148:- **SC-002**: `scratch/unsafe-rows.txt` lists exactly the runs whose unsafe count moved\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/038-alignment-p1-remediation/spec.md:158:| Risk | The checkout boundary moves stored unsafe counts | Medium | Every moved count is restated and each run named in `unsafe-rows.txt` |\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/038-alignment-p1-remediation/spec.md:186:- Failure path: an unknown suffix after a known one, as in `:auto:draft`, reads as no command\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/038-alignment-p1-remediation/spec.md:197:| Risk | 8/25 | Stored unsafe counts move |\n=== root spec hits ===\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/038-alignment-p1-remediation/acceptance-criteria.md:55:| AC-002 | REQ-002 | Given an ask row and a must-not-start row that write inside an arena under the temp folder, When `startState` judges them with the arena as checkout, Then both are unsafe and a scratch note outside it is not | the three new `startState` cases pass, and the two arena ca