{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794836774470,"sessionID":"ses_e1b71e012ffe1Z7OkhaCysQjW9","part":{"partID":"prt_1e49bb2dc0024lqG6GY41zLbr9","sessionID":"ses_e1b71e012ffe1Z7OkhaCysQjW9","messageID":"msg_1e49bac9f001IAJGTUwIwlQ0JB","type":"tool","id":"call_3856dc97fb2546f9b110017e","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"---\n\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n\n- A symlinked scratch path as a false negative: the guard reads transcript text only and never resolves links, so no in-reach input sends a link-resolved escape (iteration 1).\n- A `:with-*` chain breaking `/create:with-human-voice`: the end anchor keeps it out (iteration 1, probed).\n- A git-ignored write counting as unsafe: the changed-path list already drops it and the transcript check is documented to keep it (iteration 1).\n\n---\n\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Dimension: security\n- Focus: the guarded-write verdict as a safety signal and the reader-side trust boundary.\n- Reason: correctness covered; next risk-ordered dimension.\n- Rotation status: D1 complete, D2 next, D3 and D4 remaining.\n- Required evidence: a trust-boundary read of the transcript-to-event path, and a ruled-out record per escape shape.\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->","oldString":"---\n\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n\n- [Populated per iteration]\n\n---\n\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Dimension: correctness\n- Focus: `guardedWriteCounts`, `SELF_AUTO`, `MODE_SUFFIX` in `score-command-transcripts.mjs`\n- Reason: fresh lineage, first dimension in risk order.\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-9/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-9/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scori