{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794837246893,"sessionID":"ses_e1b71e012ffe1Z7OkhaCysQjW9","part":{"partID":"prt_1e4a2cf6f001jK1Jn04BMattUP","sessionID":"ses_e1b71e012ffe1Z7OkhaCysQjW9","messageID":"msg_1e4a2bc470010kFYxaBxVlLykX","type":"tool","id":"call_af7aaaf42805451694897d07","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"# Review Iteration 005 - cross-reference confirmation\n\n## Dispatcher\n\n- Lineage: `scorer-9` (pass nine, area `scorer`), detached fan-out lineage.\n- Review target: `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build` (spec-folder).\n- Scope: the three `scorer` files at the reviewed commit.\n- Review focus addressed: all four dimensions are covered, so this pass re-reads the area's cited lines against the four carried findings instead of opening a new direction. The brief's holdout rule held and no new source was opened.\n\n## Files Reviewed\n\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:613` - `MODE_SUFFIX`, unchanged (re-read).\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:1363` - `SELF_AUTO`, unchanged (re-read).\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:1526` - the scratch test behind S9-P2-001, unchanged (re-read).\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-transcript-score.vitest.ts:1491` - the arena block, unchanged (read in iterations 1-2).\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md:135` - the row, unchanged (read in iterations 1-3).\n\n## Findings - New\n\n### P0 Findings\n\nNone.\n\n### P1 Findings\n\nNone.\n\n### P2 Findings\n\nNone. The four carried P2s were re-read at their cited lines and none changed state.\n\n## Traceability Checks\n\n- `spec_code` stays `partial` (REQ-002 matches; the file's suffix and self-auto changes are unowned) - no new evidence to raise it.\n- `checklist_evidence` stays `pass` (AC-002's cases exist and assert the claimed outcomes) - no new evidence.\n- No dimension remains, so this pass is the confirmation the loop's coverage gate needs before a clean stop.\n\n## Integration Evidence\n\n- `git status --porcelain` over the three reviewed paths is empty, so nothing in the area changed during this lineage and every citation still resolves at `05f776202e0`.\n- The working tree's only writes are inside `review/lineages/scorer-9/`, which keeps the review observation-only.\n\n## Edge Cases\n\n- A no-finding confirmation pass is recorded as a real pass, not as a skipped one: the four findings were re-read rather than re-discovered, and the ratio is 0.0 because nothing new was found.\n- The final verdict is PASS with advisories because only P2 findings are active; the cross-lineage merge recomputes the verdict from the registry, where the same four P2s sit.\n\n## Confirmed-Clean Surfaces\n\n- The guarded write rule (S9-P2-001 aside), the self-auto reading, the suffix chain, the reader boundary and the documented README contract all still match what iterations 1-4 recorded.\n- No reviewed file was modified; the config, registry and reducer outputs were written only by the gateway and the reducer.\n\n## Ruled Out\n\n- Re-opening any of the four carried findings for a different severity: no new fact arrived, and a P2's evidence already names the failing input.\n- A new direction from the README row: it describes the guard as implemented, so no claim there is unbacked.\n\n## Next Focus\n\n- Dimension: none remaining\n- Focus: synthesis\n- Reason: every dimension is covered, both core protocols are recorded, and no P0 or P1 is active.\n- Rotation status: D1-D4 complete, confirmation pass done.\n- Required evidence: the registry, dashboard and report must agree with this narrative.\n\nReview verdict: PASS\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-9/iterations/iteration-005.md"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-9/iterations/iteration-005.md","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-9/iterations/iteration-005.md"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\":\"# Review Iteration 005 - cross-reference confirmation\\n\\n## Dispatcher\\n\\n- Lineage: `scorer-9` (pass nine, area `scorer`), detached fan-out lineage.\\n- Review target: `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build` (spec-folder).\\n- Scope: the three `scorer` files at the reviewed commit.\\n- Review focus addressed: all four dimensions are covered, so this pass re-reads the area's cited lines against the four carried findings instead of opening a new direction. The brief's holdout rule held and no new source was opened.\\n\\n## Files Reviewed\\n\\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:613` - `MODE_SUFFIX`, unchanged (re-read).\\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:1363` - `SELF_AUTO`, unchanged (re-read).\\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:1526` - the scratch test behind S9-P2-001, unchanged (re-read).\\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-transcript-score.vitest.ts:1491` - the arena block, unchanged (read in iterations 1-2).\\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md:135` - the row, unchanged (read in iterations 1-3).\\n\\n## Findings - New\\n\\n### P0 Findings\\n\\nNone.\\n\\n### P1 Findings\\n\\nNone.\\n\\n### P2 Findings\\n\\nNone. The four carried P2s were re-read at their cited lines and none changed state.\\n\\n## Traceability Checks\\n\\n- `spec_code` stays `partial` (REQ-002 matches; the file's suffix and self-auto changes are unowned) - no new evidence to raise it.\\n- `checklist_evidence` stays `pass` (AC-002's cases exist and assert the claimed outcomes) - no new evidence.\\n- No dimension remains, so this pass is the confirmation the loop's coverage gate needs before a clean stop.\\n\\n## Integration Evidence\\n\\n- `git status --porcelain` over the three reviewed paths is empty, so nothing in the area changed during this lineage and every citation still resolves at `05f776202e0`.\\n- The working tree's only writes are inside `review/lineages/scorer-9/`, which keeps the review observation-only.\\n\\n## Edge Cases\\n\\n- A no-finding confirmation pass is recorded as a real pass, not as a skipped one: the four findings were re-read rather than re-discovered, and the ratio is 0.0 because nothing new was found.\\n- The final verdict is PASS with advisories because only P2 findings are active; the cross-lineage merge recomputes the verdict from the registry, where the same four P2s sit.\\n\\n## Confirmed-Clean Surfaces\\n\\n- The guarded write rule (S9-P2-001 aside), the self-auto reading, the suffix chain, the reader boundary and the documented README contract all still match what iterations 1-4 recorded.\\n- No reviewed file was modified; the config, registry and reducer outputs were written only by the gateway and the reducer.\\n\\n## Ruled Out\\n\\n- Re-opening any of the four carried findings for a different severity: no new fact arrived, and a P2's evidence already names the failing input.\\n- A new direction from the README row: it describes the guard as implemented, so no claim there is unbacked.\\n\\n## Next Focus\\n\\n- Dimension: none remaining\\n- Focus: synthesis\\n- Reason: every dimension is covered, both core protocols are recorded, and no P0 or P1 is active.\\n- Rotation status: D1-D4 complete, confirmation pass done.\\n- Required evidence: the registry, dashboard and report must agree with this narrative.\\n\\nReview verdict: PASS\\n\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-9/iterations/iteration-005.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794837237615,"end":1794837246893}}}}
