{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794837280339,"sessionID":"ses_e1b71e012ffe1Z7OkhaCysQjW9","part":{"partID":"prt_1e4a37242002uBtdSFuYZFbDPS","sessionID":"ses_e1b71e012ffe1Z7OkhaCysQjW9","messageID":"msg_1e4a3640b001vTk94AWN3s8B3j","type":"tool","id":"call_3871c0719ab54a9fb026b855","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && sed -n '84,101p' .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/state/state-outputs.md; echo \"=== synthesis append ===\"; sed -n '1990,2080p' .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review.yaml | grep -n \"append_jsonl\\|stem\\|review-report\\|section\" | head -20"},"output":"## 5. FINAL REPORT\n\n`review-report.md` is the handoff artifact. It carries:\n\n- Executive summary.\n- Planning trigger.\n- Active finding registry.\n- Remediation workstreams.\n- Spec seed.\n- Plan seed.\n- Traceability status.\n- Deferred items.\n- Audit appendix.\n- Optional Resource Map Coverage Gate section when a map existed at init.\n\n---\n\n## 6. RELATED RESOURCES\n=== synthesis append ===\n14:            node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/review-verdict.cjs \\\n42:        command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder} {reducer_artifact_arg} --create-missing-anchors --emit-resource-map\"\n56:        action: \"Compile review/review-report.md with 9 core sections, a conditional Resource Map Coverage Gate section, and an embedded Planning Packet\"\n61:             - Planning Trigger: state that `/speckit:plan` is not required, and set the Planning Packet to `triggered: false` and `reviewDidNotRun: true` with `remediationWorkstreams: []`, keeping every other required key from section 2 at an empty value.\n65:          Create review/review-report.md with the following sections:\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"## 5. FINAL REPORT\n\n`review-report.md` is the handoff artifact. It carries:\n\n- Executive summary.\n- Planning trigger.\n- Active finding registry.\n- Remediation workstreams.\n- Spec seed.\n- Plan seed.\n- Traceability status.\n- Deferred items.\n- Audit appendix.\n- Optional Resource Map Coverage Gate section when a map existed at init.\n\n---\n\n## 6. RELATED RESOURCES\n=== synthesis append ===\n14:            node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/review-verdict.cjs \\\n42:        command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder} {reducer_artifact_arg} --create-missing-anchors --emit-resource-map\"\n56:        action: \"Compile review/review-report.md with 9 core sections, a conditional Resource Map Coverage Gate section, and an embedded Planning Packet\"\n61:             - Planning Trigger: state that `/speckit:plan` is not required, and set the Planning Packet to `triggered: false` and `reviewDidNotRun: true` with `remediationWorkstreams: []`, keeping every other required key from section 2 at an empty value.\n65:          Create review/review-report.md with the following sections:\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && sed -n '84,101p' .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/state/state-outputs.md; echo \\\"=== synthesis append ===\\\"; sed -n '1990,2080p' .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review.yaml | grep -n \\\"append_jsonl\\\\|stem\\\\|review-report\\\\|section\\\" | head -20\"}"},"time":{"start":1794837279299,"end":1794837280339}}}}
